@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@phone = +919000100000
@deviceId = 11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111
@otp = REPLACE_FROM_LOCAL_TERMINAL
@accessToken = REPLACE_FROM_VERIFY_RESPONSE
@refreshToken = REPLACE_FROM_VERIFY_RESPONSE

### Configuration
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/app/bootstrap?platform=android&buildNumber=1&countryCode=IN&locale=en-IN

### Request OTP; requires npm run setup:dev locally
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/otp/request
Content-Type: application/json

{"phoneE164":"{{phone}}","countryCode":"IN"}

### Verify / sign up; replace OTP with local terminal code
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/otp/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{"phoneE164":"{{phone}}","code":"{{otp}}","deviceId":"{{deviceId}}","displayName":"Test Guardian"}

### Read private profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Edit allowed fields
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/v1/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"displayName":"My Name","locale":"en-IN","timezone":"Asia/Kolkata"}

### Refresh; replace both saved tokens after this request. Reusing old refresh revokes the family.
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{"refreshToken":"{{refreshToken}}"}

### Own device sessions
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
